# ⚠ v0.1 (Windows): every checkout gets LF, whatever `core.autocrlf` says — Git for Windows installs with
# `autocrlf=true`, which checked 1,297 files out as CRLF on the first Windows machine. Nothing is committed with CRLF;
# a fixture or a pinned digest must read the same bytes on every system. Binary files are detected as before.
* text=auto eol=lf
